<title>USA: Cypress says complaint meritless.</title>
<headline>Cypress says complaint meritless.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cypress Bioscience Inc said a complaint alleging it is infringing claims of a certain patent issued to a third party in the manufacture, use and sale of its PROSORBA column is without merit.</p>
<p>It said it plans to contest the claims. The company further said it believes that any final resolution of the claims will not have a material adverse effect on the company's financial condition or operations.</p>
</text>
